ow to Request a Refund</h2></div><div class="space-y-6 text-[#0F0F0F]/70"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#0F0F0F] mb-3">Refund Request Process</h3><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3"><li><strong>Email Us:</strong> Send a refund request to <a href="mailto:codesommet@gmail.com" class="text-[#00AEEF] hover:underline"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="caa2afa6a6a58abaa3a1abb9b9a5b9bebfaea3a5e4a9a5a7">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></li><li><strong>Subject Line:</strong> Use &quot;Refund Request - [Your Name/Company]&quot;</li><li><strong>Include Information:</strong><ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1"><li>Full name and email used for payment</li><li>Invoice number or transaction ID</li><li>Service type (Retainer or Website Development)</li><li>Reason for refund request</li><li>Preferred refund method (original payment method or alternative)</li></ul></li><li><strong>Review Period:</strong> We will review your request within 3 business days</li><li><strong>Decision:</strong> You will receive a written response with our decision and refund amount (if applicable)</li><li><strong>Processing:</strong> Approved refunds are processed within 5-10 business days</li><li><strong>Refund Timeline:</strong> Allow 5-10 business days for refunds to appear in your account after processing</li></ol></div><div class="bg-[#00AEEF]/5 rounded-lg p-6 border border-[#00AEEF]/20"><h4 class="font-semibold text-[#0F0F0F] mb-3">Refund Method</h4><p class="mb-2">Refunds will be issued using the same payment method used for the original purchase:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1"><li><strong>Credit/Debit Card:</strong> Refund to the original card (5-10 business days)</li><li><strong>Bank Transfer:</strong> Refund to the original bank account (3-7 business days)</li><li><strong>Alternative Method:</strong> Available upon request (may incur additional processing time)</li></ul></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#0F0F0F] mb-3">Dispute Resolution</h3>